#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about activity tracking events for Qiskit Runtime."
msgstr "Découvre les événements de suivi d'activité pour Qiskit Runtime."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for Qiskit Runtime"
msgstr "Événements de suivi d'activité pour Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activity tracking events for Qiskit Runtime {#activity-tracking-events-for-"
"qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr ""
"Événements de suivi d'activité pour Qiskit Runtime {#activity-tracking-"
"events-for-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as Qiskit Runtime, generate activity tracking "
"events.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les services IBM Cloud&reg;, tels que Qiskit Runtime, génèrent des "
"événements de suivi d'activité.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activity tracking events report on activities that change the state of a "
"service in IBM Cloud. You can use the events to investigate abnormal "
"activity and critical actions and to comply with regulatory audit "
"requirements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les événements de suivi d'activité rendent compte des activités qui "
"modifient l'état d'un service dans IBM Cloud. Tu peux utiliser ces "
"événements pour enquêter sur des activités anormales et des actions "
"critiques, et pour répondre aux exigences des audits réglementaires.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, a platform service, to"
" route auditing events in your account to destinations of your choice by "
"configuring targets and routes that define where activity tracking events "
"are sent. For more information, see [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events"
" Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux utiliser IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, un service de "
"plateforme, pour acheminer les événements d'audit de ton compte vers les "
"destinations de ton choix en configurant des cibles et des routes qui "
"définissent où les événements de suivi d'activité sont envoyés. Pour plus "
"d'informations, consulte [À propos du routage des événements IBM Cloud "
"Activity Tracker.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-"
"about)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Logs to visualize and alert on events that are "
"generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event "
"Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux utiliser IBM Cloud Logs pour visualiser et recevoir des alertes sur "
"les événements générés dans ton compte et acheminés par IBM Cloud Activity "
"Tracker Event Routing vers une instance IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Locations where activity tracking events are generated {#locations-where-"
"activity-tracking-events-are-generated}"
msgstr ""
"Emplacements où les événements de suivi d'activité sont générés {#locations-"
"where-activity-tracking-events-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Runtime sends activity tracking events in the following regions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Runtime envoie des événements de suivi d'activité dans les régions "
"suivantes :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Washington (\"us-east\")\n"
msgstr "Washington (« us-east »)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Frankfurt (\"eu-de\")\n"
msgstr "Francfort (« eu-de »)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Viewing activity tracking events for Qiskit Runtime {#viewing-activity-"
"tracking-events-for-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr ""
"Consultation des événements de suivi d'activité pour Qiskit Runtime "
"{#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launching IBM Cloud Logs from the Observability page {#launching-ibm-cloud-"
"logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr ""
"Lancer IBM Cloud Logs depuis la page Observabilité {#launching-ibm-cloud-"
"logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the "
"UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-"
"launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour plus d'informations sur le lancement de l'interface utilisateur IBM "
"Cloud Logs, consulte [Lancement de l'interface "
"utilisateur](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-"
"instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) dans la documentation IBM Cloud "
"Logs.\n"

